<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraqi security forces are intercepting and destroying explosive-laden drones while a militia leader publicly criticized Iraq’s stance on the Iran blockade, and Iraqi officials met with Trump to reaffirm that Iraq will not be used to attack neighboring countries. A security guard was killed and three people injured in a shooting at an oilfield near Kirkuk, and Turkey is supporting Iraqi counter-ISIS efforts in Kirkuk and reinforcing border posts. The U.S. Embassy warned citizens of security risks, and the UCDP recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiS0FVX3lxTFBzaFJZZExPMUZIc04yc0lMZzBCY1A3Vk56eG4yS0dVLXdZd1otbFM4S1Y2eW10eTZBbWFqd29xN04xamN5VklGNGp2RQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New Region&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxPZXNxMExNSFJCNGtHdFM2dGYwNW9OcV9jcmVIdVBLZlk5ZXFkWjBfWEZMZjBBTTdfakprWmhwTUVHYlBSWjRlWDhEdm9JOExvNUE0Z2lQZHlSdm1JTWVNZnd3RFh4N05WamZFOWNpNUlHV284RXpxbTh2U2Z6ZTFZSlo3Ylo1STZONlRzYzFkT1FGSXJNbE5yYmtR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kurdistan24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxPWFpxMG9oZk9WbnlhU1lTRnFraTJkVzBtek5nUUVlc2VzbHViUGdKSXdRRVRSZ1FmUDdjcjBmSGptOFZyaW5nWUY1c25qZVdfdDdNRzM0dHJKSFpZM002VkZvcHlGN3RtaDFIeERTLXF6M1ZJQkZtLURUOWRWenJLZXZwOHhKbl9NSERsSA?oc=5&quot;&gt;شفق نيوز&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxQMHZjUzFDQm9TekxqQmZ5X0I1WE1adlM5ZzdFZWE4Z3VXUjJKWlBCRUJ3MU5tcnRYLXNpalFzNHpLai1GZHFCemRJU25NTVcwQldUTEhNaWZ2akw1MnVicGdoNnB1T1ByLS1MQzl4RW9MeWNKczhqRHhsdEVmM0tWYVJaOXBZWjJWQkJFd0JB?oc=5&quot;&gt;شفق نيوز&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.c